# A file of the lent folder downloaded to the device: right clicked, 下载: 正在下载「…」,
# read through the core (drive.read), kept where the system keeps downloads (@hostapi.keep_begin: MediaStore's Downloads
# on Android, MBUI_DOWNLOADS_DIR on macOS): 已保存到「下载」.
#env MBUI_OPEN_PAGE=files
timeout 90000
until =e2e-{T}
tap =e2e-{T}
until 说明.txt
rightclick 说明.txt
until =下载
shot 1-menu
tap =下载
until 正在下载「说明.txt」
shot 2-downloading
until 已保存到「下载」
shot 3-saved
